select public.admin_notify('⚠️ "App not active" fix-guide', 'Login URL kholne par business.facebook.com par "App not active" mila. Fix sequence: (1) top menu **Required actions** tab kholo — jo items hon (email/phone verify, privacy policy, etc.) complete karo; (2) Settings→Basic me **Privacy Policy URL** bharo: https://deepsilence10161-source.github.io/ff-user-panel/privacy-policy.html (hamara hosted page, live 200) → Save; (3) developer registration ka Meta verification email/phone code complete karo; (4) dashboard me koi "deactivated/restrict" banner ho to uska link follow karo; (5) phir Login URL retry. Na khule to Required actions + Settings→Basic ke screenshots bhejo.', 'session_end') as notified;
